From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gemstone <gemstone@localhost>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:43:56 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 14/14] drm/tidss, drm/imagination: build on the 6.12 DRM core

- tidss: 6.12 bridge callbacks (attach() without encoder, atomic_pre_enable/
  post_disable with drm_bridge_state), devm_drm_bridge_alloc() replaced by
  devm_kzalloc() (tidss_compat612.h), drm_fbdev_dma_setup() instead of
  drm_client_setup(), standard commit helpers instead of the split ones
  (DPI outputs do not need the OLDI ordering)
- imagination: drm_gem_shmem_vmap/vunmap, drm_sched_start(sched),
  DRM_GPU_SCHED_STAT_NOMINAL, drm_gpuvm_sm_map() with explicit range,
  local drm_sched_job_has_dependency()
---
